        <p><seg source="#source-22213-22216">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-22216-22243"><rb>御懇意</rb><rt>ごこんい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-22243-22246">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-22246-22264"><rb>間</rb><rt>あひだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-22264-22267">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-22267-22279"><rb>云</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-22279-22303">ひ、それにです。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-22303-22324"><rb>貴方</rb><rt>あなた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-22324-22327">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-22327-22345"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-22345-22360">のためには</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-22360-22384"><rb>恩人</rb><rt>おんじん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-22384-22417">でおいでなさる。――お</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-22417-22432"><rb>前</rb><rt>まへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-22432-22438">もお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-22438-22450"><rb>聞</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-22450-22459">きよ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-22459-22477"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-22477-22480">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-22480-22504"><rb>毎日</rb><rt>まいにち</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-22504-22531"><rb>出勤</rb><rt>しゆつきん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-22531-22543">するあの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-22543-22570"><rb>破堂</rb><rt>やぶれだう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-22570-22573">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-22573-22588"><rb>中</rb><rt>なか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-22588-22594">で、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-22594-22609"><rb>顏</rb><rt>かほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-22609-22612">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-22612-22627"><rb>汗</rb><rt>