        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-44960-44972">これが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-44972-44996"><rb>植込</rb><rt>うゑこみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-44996-44999">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-44999-45014"><rb>遙</rb><rt>はる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-45014-45020">かに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45020-45035"><rb>透</rb><rt>すか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-45035-45041">し、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45041-45056"><rb>門</rb><rt>もん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-45056-45059">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45059-45074"><rb>外</rb><rt>そと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-45074-45098">からあからさまに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45098-45110"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-45110-45122">えた、と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45122-45134"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-45134-45137">る</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45137-45149"><rb>間</rb><rt>ま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-45149-45161">もなく、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45161-45179"><rb>件</rb><rt>くだん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-45179-45182">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45182-45212"><rb>美少年</rb><rt>びせうねん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-45212-45215">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45215-45233"><rb>姿</rb><rt>すがた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-45233-45239">は、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45239-45257"><rb>大</rb><rt>おほき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-45257-45260">な</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45260-45275"><rb>蝶</rb><rt>てふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-45275-45278">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-45278-45293"><rb>影</rb><rt>かげ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-45293-45296">を</seg><ruby t