        <p><seg source="#source-58599-58602">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-58602-58614"><rb>退</rb><rt>ど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-58614-58620">け、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-58620-58641"><rb>射殺</rb><rt>いころ</rt></ruby>すぞ。」</p>
